example, donating real estate, stocks, artwork or other assets. Many planned giving options offer generous tax benefits as well.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">Whether it is naming WPV as the beneficiary of a life insurance policy or gifting other liquid or non-liquid assets, we encourage you to consult with your financial advisor to discuss the options.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">Thank you again for your support of our mission, now and in the future. Your generosity and philanthropic legacy will long be remembered. Please contact 310-695-7030 or\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:info@thewpv.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">info@thewpv.org<\/a>\u00a0with any questions or for further discussion.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/thewpv.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Image-8-5-25-at-9.35-AM.jpeg&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#2a98ac&#8221; height=&#8221;112px&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;||0px|||&#8221; global_module=&#8221;2125&#8243; collapsed=&#8221;off&#8221;][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; gutter_width=&#8221;2&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; width=&#8221;100%&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_code _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#f5f9fe&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;left&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;|||0px|false|false&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|||23px|false|false&#8221;][\/et_pb_code][et_pb_code _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;]<givebutter-widget id=\"gKBY9L\"><\/givebutter-widget><!-- [et_pb_line_break_hol